   263	successor computation as soon as review closes.
   264	
   265	This integration promotes a conditional degree-three surface theorem, not a
   266	surface-existence theorem.  It does not classify all exceptional
   267	discrepancies or Kodaira fibres, prove normal/global compatibility of an
   268	invariant solution, supply the dominant `A2` map, produce a polynomial map,
